        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "My computer crashed completely. I updated some drivers from another source, and not from Microsoft, which i should have done. Just a blank screen, that's it, way above my pay grade.  I was guided to Andrey at JAS info Technologies. I dropped off my desk top on Monday at noon. I got a call from Andrey in the evening. My computer was up and running. No damage. I picked it up on Tues. and Andrey spent some time with me going over a complete set up. Wow. I was impressed with the personal service. Just can't find service like this in the big shops. My system is 10 years old and it runs like it was new. Thank you very much Andrey. You are my go to if i have any problems.",
        "time": 1739398828,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maya C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113151923234961185307/reviews",
        "language": "en",
