        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Excellent IT service and customer service! Highly recommended for their professionalism, fast service, high attention to details, and dedication!\nNot to mention the very reasonable pricing.\n\nWould definitely remain a loyal customer.",
        "time": 1724120996,
