        "text": "I cannot describe how satisfied I am with the work of andrei. I have been doing business with him since 2014 and everything has been going smooth since then! He is always available for emergency calls which is great, especially because I have a business to run and can’t afford to have some computers down. Keep up the good work! I recommend to all, also super clean work!",
